{
  "appliance_id": "b7e9c2d1-4a5f-4b8e-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d",
  "name": "IEC 61850 IED Publisher",
  "category": "guest",
  "description": "IEC 61850 GOOSE/SV traffic publisher (simulated IED). Emits GOOSE (0x88B8) and Sampled Values (0x88BA) frames on its Ethernet port with configurable APPID, rate, VLAN ID and priority, including GOOSE-style retransmission bursts. Use with the Subscriber node or a real IED/substation switch to verify PRP transparency.",
  "vendor_name": "Arctic3D AB",
  "vendor_url": "https://arctic3d.xyz",
  "product_name": "IEC 61850 IED Publisher",
  "registry_version": 6,
  "status": "experimental",
  "maintainer": "Arctic3D AB",
  "maintainer_email": "ceo@arctic3d.xyz",
  "usage": "# IEC 61850 IED Publisher\n\nSimulated IED that publishes **real** IEC 61850 GOOSE (0x88B8) and\nSampled Values (0x88BA) frames — full ASN.1/BER APDUs that Wireshark\nand real IEDs decode. Attach the node to a RedBox SAN port. The console\nshows a live stats view; the telnet aux console (port 5000) gives a\nshell.\n\n## Environment variables\n\nSet these per node (right-click → Configure → General → Environment):\n\n| Variable | Default | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|\n| `IEC_MODE` | `publisher` | IED personality (publisher or subscriber) |\n| `IEC_APPID` | `0x1001` | GOOSE application ID (hex) |\n| `IEC_ET` | `goose` | `goose` (0x88B8) or `sv` (0x88BA) |\n| `IEC_RATE` | `5` | publish rate in Hz |\n| `IEC_VID` | `0` | VLAN ID; 0 = null VLAN + priority tagging (IEC 61850 legacy default) |\n| `IEC_PCP` | `4` | 802.1Q priority bits |\n| `IEC_MCAST` | per `IEC_ET` | destination MAC override |\n| `IEC_GCB` | `LLN0$GO$gcb0` | GOOSE control-block reference (gocbRef) |\n| `IEC_DSET` | `LLN0$dataset` | GOOSE dataset reference (datSet) |\n| `IEC_GOID` | `LLN0$GO$gcb0` | GOOSE ID (goID) |\n| `IEC_CONFREV` | `1` | configuration revision (confRev) |\n| `IEC_SVID` | `MU01` | SV svID |\n| `IEC_STEVENTS` | `10` | GOOSE state changes per N events (stNum++) |\n\nGOOSE `stNum` increments on each state change, `sqNum` per retransmission\n(2/4/8/16… ms bursts); SV `smpCnt` increments per frame (mod 4096).\n\n## Verification\n\nPair with the Subscriber node on the other side of a PRP network or HSR\nring: the subscriber console showing `dupes=0` proves exactly-once\ndelivery.\n",
  "docker": {
    "adapters": 1,
    "image": "ghcr.io/grymme/prp-sim:latest",
    "console_type": "telnet",
    "environment": "IEC_MODE=publisher\nIEC_APPID=0x1001\nIEC_RATE=5\nIEC_VID=0\nIEC_PCP=4\nIEC_ET=goose"
  },
  "symbols": {
    "default": "symbols/iec61850-publisher.svg"
  }
}
